Cloakfox: scoped HackerRank media failover compatibility.

Refresh only the application's stale local participant ID after Zoom reconnects.
The child actor is restricted to the top-level HTTPS /pair/ application.

--- a/toolkit/modules/ActorManagerParent.sys.mjs
+++ b/toolkit/modules/ActorManagerParent.sys.mjs
@@ -90,6 +90,15 @@
  * available at https://firefox-source-docs.mozilla.org/dom/ipc/jsactors.html
  */
 let JSWINDOWACTORS = {
+  // Site compatibility: refresh HackerRank's local Zoom ID after failover.
+  CloakfoxHackerRankMedia: {
+    child: {
+      esModuleURI: "resource:///actors/CloakfoxHackerRankMediaChild.sys.mjs",
+      events: { DOMDocElementInserted: {} },
+    },
+    allFrames: false,
+    matches: ["https://www.hackerrank.com/pair/*"],
+  },
   // Cloakfox: pin fingerprinting-relevant CSS media features so
   // window.matchMedia reports persona-coherent, host-independent values
